        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Lower back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradual onset 2 days ago; central across the belt line; aching and stiff; VAS approximately 5–6/10. Worse with bending and standing from sitting; improves somewhat when lying flat. No trauma, fall, or heavy lifting reported. Non-radiating, with no leg symptoms."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological and spinal red-flag symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies saddle anaesthesia, leg weakness, paraesthesia, gait disturbance, unexplained weight loss, night sweats, and history of cancer or IV drug use. No significant trauma reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Urinary and bowel-control symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Passing urine normally. Denies urinary incontinence, urinary retention, and change in bowel control."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
